  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひとけりで　トラックを　ころがすきょうじんな　きゃくりょくを　くししエキゾチックな　おどりを　みせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "발차기 한 번에 트럭을 굴려 버릴 정도로 강한 다릿심을 활용하여 이국적인 춤을 선보인다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會善用只要一踢就能踢翻卡車的強韌腳力，展現充滿異國風情的舞蹈。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il peut propulser un camion dans les airs d’un simple coup de pied. Ses puissantes pattes lui permettent aussi d’exécuter des danses insolites.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit einem einzigen Tritt kann es Lastwagen umwerfen. Es nutzt seine kräftigen Beine, um Tänze aus fernen Ländern aufzuführen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Realiza una exótica danza mientras controla la tremenda fuerza de sus extremidades, capaces de hacer volcar un camión de una patada.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si esibisce in danze esotiche sfruttando l’incredibile forza degli arti inferiori, capaci di far rotolare via un camion con un solo colpo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "A single kick from a Quaquaval can send a truck rolling. This Pokémon uses its powerful legs to perform striking dances from far-off lands.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひと蹴りで　トラックを　転がす強靭な　脚力を　駆使しエキゾチックな　踊りを　みせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "活用只要一脚就能踢翻卡车的强韧脚力，展现充满异国风情的舞蹈。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Realiza una exótica danza mientras controla la tremenda fuerza de sus extremidades, capaces de hacer volcar un camión de una patada.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "いこくじょうちょ　あふれる　ダンスでみるものを　みりょうし　みずでできたかざりはねを　ふりまわし　きりさく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "이국적인 느낌이 강한 댄스로 보는 이를 매료시킨 다음 물로 만든 깃털 장식을 휘둘러 베어 버린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會用充滿異國情調的舞蹈迷倒看到的對手，然後揮舞以水構成的羽飾將其劈裂。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa danse insolite est captivante. Il met ses adversaires en pièces à l’aide de ses plumes ornementales composées d’eau.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit seinen ausgefallenen Tänzen betört es alle, die ihm zuschauen. Es schlitzt Gegner mit einem Schwung seiner Schmuckfedern aus Wasser auf.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Embelesa a quien lo ve con una danza que rebosa de exotismo y corta a sus rivales con sus plumas ornamentales hechas de agua.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cattura lo sguardo dell’avversario con una danza esotica e lo squarcia agitando le piume ornamentali fatte di acqua.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dancing in ways that evoke far-away places, this Pokémon mesmerizes all that see it. Flourishes of its decorative water feathers slice into its foes.",
      "language": {
